<view class="page cards-page" style="padding-top: {{statusBarHeight}}px;">
  <view class="nav" style="height: {{navHeight}}px;"><view class="brand-mark"></view><text class="brand">好好生活 · 灵感卡</text></view>
  <view class="cards-intro"><view><view class="eyebrow">A SMALL IDEA, A FRESH START</view><view class="page-heading">给生活，一点新灵感。</view></view><text class="intro-spark">✳</text></view>
  <view class="page-subtitle">随手翻一张，有共鸣的就留下。</view>
  <scroll-view class="category-scroll" scroll-x enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="category-list"><button class="category-chip {{chapterId === 0 ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="selectChapter" data-id="0">随便看看</button><button wx:for="{{chapters}}" wx:key="id" class="category-chip {{chapterId === item.id ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="selectChapter" data-id="{{item.id}}">{{item.title}}</button></view></scroll-view>
  <swiper wx:if="{{cards.length}}" class="cards-swiper" current="{{current}}" bindchange="onCardChange" circular="{{false}}" previous-margin="0rpx" next-margin="20rpx" duration="260">
    <swiper-item wx:for="{{cards}}" wx:key="id"><view class="inspiration-card {{index % 3 === 1 ? 'card-light' : index % 3 === 2 ? 'card-sage' : ''}}"><view class="card-top"><text class="card-category">{{item.chapterLabel}}</text><text class="card-index">{{index + 1 &lt; 10 ? '0' : ''}}{{index + 1}} / {{cards.length &lt; 10 ? '0' : ''}}{{cards.length}}</text></view><view class="quote-mark">“</view><view class="card-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="card-divider"></view><view class="card-summary">{{item.coverSummary}}</view><view class="card-bottom"><view><view class="card-source">HowToLiveBetter · {{item.codeLabel}}</view><view class="card-rating">{{item.evidenceText ? '原文评级 ' + item.evidenceText : '一条有出处的生活建议'}}</view></view><text class="card-spark">✳</text></view></view></swiper-item>
  </swiper>
  <view wx:else class="empty"><view class="empty-title">这个主题的卡片还在整理</view><view class="empty-copy">先试试「随便看看」吧。</view></view>
  <view class="swipe-guide"><view class="card-navigation"><button class="card-step" bindtap="previousCard" disabled="{{current === 0 || !cards.length}}" aria-label="上一张">‹</button><view class="page-dots"><view wx:for="{{cards}}" wx:key="id" class="page-dot {{index === current ? 'active' : ''}}"></view></view><button class="card-step" bindtap="nextCard" disabled="{{current >= cards.length - 1}}" aria-label="下一张">›</button></view><text>{{cards.length > 1 ? '左右滑动，慢慢挑选' : '一条小小的灵感'}}</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{cards.length}}" class="card-actions"><button bindtap="toggleFavorite" class="card-action {{favorite ? 'is-favorite' : ''}}"><text>{{favorite ? '★' : '☆'}}</text>{{favorite ? '已收藏' : '收藏'}}</button><button bindtap="openCurrent" class="card-action"><text>↗</text>读完整建议</button><button open-type="share" class="card-action"><text>↑</text>分享</button></view>
  <button class="primary-button draw-button" bindtap="draw"><text class="shuffle-symbol">↻</text>换一组灵感</button>
  <view class="cards-note"><view>灵感不是任务清单。选择适合自己的就好。</view><view>卡片摘自日常主题，完整说明与出处请点开阅读。</view></view>
</view>
